        "source": "CNC mill from aluminium billet. Flat underside is mounting plane z=0. Two integral lower seats; matched caps close on z=35. Finish both seats coaxially with caps fitted, retaining the axial shoulder lips. Nominal seat 22.02 x 7.20; shoulder opening 19.00. Establish seat tolerance, coaxiality, flatness and lip contact on actual bearing outer rings before release. Four blind M4x0.7 tapped holes: drill 3.3 mm, provide 12 mm usable thread below split plane with sufficient drill-point depth; CAD shows 4 mm major-diameter thread envelopes, not tap drills or helical threads. Four external mounting holes 5.5 mm, pattern 96 x 50. No adhesive needed."
